    "https://ewal.fa.us8.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/12143": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor - Physical Therapy Dallas",
      "description": "Texas Woman’s University (TWU) School of Physical Therapy is hiring for a full-time 9-month, tenure-track, faculty position at the rank of Assistant/Associate Professor for our Dallas campus. The School of Physical Therapy currently offers DPT and PhD programs on our Dallas, Denton, and Houston campuses. We also collaborate with community partners to offer residency programs in neurology and women’s health. TWU’s School of Physical Therapy program has a long history of success for over 55 years. ",
      "department": null
