    "https://ewal.fa.us8.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/12030": {
      "title": "Program Director - Health Care Administration-Houston",
      "description": "The Director of the Health Care Administration (HCA) Program provides visionary, strategic, and operational leadership for the Master of Health Care Administration (MHA) program at Texas Woman’s University. Based at the Houston Center, the Director oversees programmatic delivery across both the Houston and Dallas campuses and leads the program’s efforts to maintain academic excellence, CAHME accreditation, industry relevance, and student success.",
